# Production build defaults that are safe to commit.
#
# Vite loads this file for `npm run build` only (not for `npm run dev` or the
# tests). A build environment variable with the same name, such as one set in
# the Cloudflare Pages project settings, takes precedence over a value here.
#
# ONLY public IDs belong in this file. Anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into
# the public JS bundle, and a pixel ID is visible in the page source of every
# site that uses one. Never put the Meta Conversions API token, or any other
# secret, here: those go in Cloudflare Pages secrets (see .dev.vars.example).

# Meta (Facebook) pixel / dataset id. Created by Nathan in Ads Manager on
# 2026-10-08. It is loaded only for visitors who allow the `advertising`
# consent category (src/analytics.js); Meta's stock snippet is deliberately NOT
# pasted into index.html, because it would load for everyone before they choose.
VITE_META_PIXEL_ID=29103492982601698
